# zdesk's mouse (docs/man/zdesk.txt "FILES"). A user's ~/.config/zdesk/mouse replaces this file.
# acceleration none|low|high: a fast move goes further. low doubles the counts beyond 4 in a frame (a fiftieth of a
# second on PAL), high triples those beyond 2; none moves 2 pixels across and 1 line down a count, always.
acceleration low
